OpenXcom rule files (standard/xcom1)
====================================

Source:     OpenXcom, https://openxcom.org, https://github.com/OpenXcom/OpenXcom
            bin/standard/xcom1/*.rul (the "standard" X-COM: UFO Defense mod)
Copyright:  OpenXcom Developers.
Licence:    GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (see ../../COPYING).
            These files are OpenXcom's work, redistributed here unchanged
            under the same licence; xcom-xt is GPL v3 or later too.

They describe the original game's terrains, map scripts, UFOs, craft, alien
races, deployments, units, armour, items, facilities, regions, countries and
UFO trajectories, and OpenXcom's corrections to the MCD terrain files
(mcdPatches.rul: big wall kinds, HE blockage, armour, flammability). The converter (tools/xcomconv.py) reads them to build the
packs; it needs them next to it (XCOMCONV.EXE carries a copy).

Only the files the converter reads are included (19 of OpenXcom's). Texts
(the Language folder) are NOT included: the converter reads the game's texts
from the player's own copy of X-COM (GEODATA/ENGLISH.DAT).
